---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Choose an engineer for your session" description="Find current engineer choices in Legacy Music Group’s live booking calendar. Select your service and check availability, or ask the studio who fits your project."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The right people in the room</p><h1>Find your<br /><em>session fit.</em></h1><p>Your project, preferred time and chosen service shape the engineer options. See the current choices in the booking calendar.</p></header><div class="service-body section-bottom"><div><h2>A preference?<br />Start there.</h2><p>Choose your service, then open the engineer selector. Pick a name or leave it on Any to explore the available times.</p><p>If you want help deciding, tell the studio what you’re recording and what kind of session you need.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary booking-handoff" href={business.bookingUrl}>See engineer availability ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask the studio</a></div></div><div class="booking-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Before you choose</p><h2>Make the brief useful.</h2><ul><li>The type of music or recording.</li><li>What you want to finish in the session.</li><li>Your preferred date and session length.</li><li>A rough recording or reference, if you have one.</li></ul><p class="small">Engineer availability is confirmed in the live calendar. This page does not promise a particular person or time slot.</p></div></div></div><Cta /></Layout>
